      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems like the documentation for how performance gated instances was inaccurate with the details glossed over.\n\nMost likely it behaves the same as avatar performance blocking, where exceeding the bounds does nothing, and exceeding the amount of physbones disables all physbones, but no impostor.",
