  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When entering a performance-gated instance where the only violated restriction is Bounding Box, the usual warning message will trigger but your avatar will not be hidden nor forced into an impostor/fallback. Tested with an avatar that only violates the >70k tris count for a Poor rated instance and it blocked the avatar as expected.",
